.TH geectl-request-diff 1  "geectl-request-diff 0.2.4" 
.SH NAME
geectl\-request\-diff \- Show the diff of a submit request: the unified diff, or the request XML with the diff injected with `\-\-xml`
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgeectl request diff\fR [\fB\-\-xml\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIID\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show the diff of a submit request: the unified diff, or the request XML with the diff injected with `\-\-xml`
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-xml\fR
Render the request XML with the diff injected, instead of the unified diff
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIID\fR>
The request id
.SH VERSION
v0.2.4
